# Canonical rules: AGENTS.md

Read AGENTS.md before making changes.

Hard rules:
1. English for all repository artifacts; chat follows the user's language.
2. VS 2026 / toolset v145 / C++20 first-party / C++17 plugins.
3. Windows 10 1809+ target; no XP support.
4. Dependencies via vcpkg manifest (vcpkg.json).
5. Branch off develop; push only your feature branch.
6. GitHub Issues/Projects/Milestones/PRs for shared tracking; .local/ for session notes.
7. Do not bulk-reformat; do not edit Plugins/PluginWizard/**.

See MODERNIZATION.md for the full multi-phase plan.
